Hijack for Artists: "Lose Control On Purpose" (promo, 1080×1920, 67 s)

Product, copy and screens: Hijack (hijack.co.in). Screens are rebuilt from the live site's own
  artist landing page and product shots, plus Jack Tucker's public Hijack page (hijack.co.in/jack-tucker).
