B-roll: Higgsfield, Seedance 2.5 text-to-video (broll/a.mp4, b.mp4, c.mp4). All people are fictional.
Fonts: Space Grotesk, Inter, JetBrains Mono (SIL OFL, via @fontsource). The same families the site uses.
Built with HyperFrames + GSAP.
